  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\"><br></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D169%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20190315094611&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile268.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99FB5D415C947C20395301')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> B4지구내부모형만들기홍은선편집(입체-자포함-지각확대.hwp</a></p><p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">김정식 선생님 자료를 활용했습니다.<br>고퀄리티 작품 2점 공유합니다.<br>수업 끝나고 와서 바로 ㅋㅋ <br>저도 감동 받앗네요<br><br>지구내부 구조와 유사한 주변의 물체를 찾아 그림과 설명 쓰기에서 과일 말고도 다양한 의견이 나왔습니다.<br>과녁판, 선풍기, 태양계, 자전거 바퀴, 벽시계, 김밥 단면, 연필 단면 두루마리 휴지 단면...</p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4c4f14ed2fb94701ff52c680f284a2db931ee98\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fe11c78086639900c580cc2420bb6381502cd545\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e7a8c913519fd47e3e7fada7b06f9feb11c2db5\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b553969342bc69fee14b2cae0a980b621ce2541b\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf9aab64a56e8742fb175fe69a80888c9fae5221\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2cc66ea77d2f7d8f9a6e2915f1cdcc3a83c67acb\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c81bb13e7616981497af7b615cf356b79919928a\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/497b3b340623750fed43e20d14ba826aafb049cd\" class=\"txc-image\" /></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
